&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/182319/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500 !important;   "&gt;React Native Sandbox 0.5&lt;/a&gt; – Run multiple, isolated RN instances within an app.&lt;/p&gt;
